- id: '2097633476489224629'
  text: 'Ever since GPT Image 2.5 dropped, I''ve been seeing so many people use it
    to make sprite sheets.


    It instantly reminded me of a pixel game I built about six months ago with Image
    2 + GPT 5.5.


    So I had to try it again. I rebuilt the idea on @happycapyai with Image 2.5 +
    Astra, and the jump in quality is kind of insane. It’s wild how much has changed
    in just six months.


    I dropped the game link and prompt in the comments 👇'
