- id: '2097633487016874023'
  text: '[prompt]

    Create a complete 2D side-scrolling narrative action pixel-art game starring a
    chibi, miniature magical girl hero inspired by classic moon-themed magical girl
    anime.


    The character should retain the iconic visual language of a moon-themed magical
    heroine: golden twin-bun hairstyle with long twin tails, a red-blue-white sailor-inspired
    outfit, red boots, a golden crescent moon symbol on her forehead, a cute miniature
    body proportion, and a gentle but courageous expression.


    Do not use realistic human proportions.


    Design the player as a polished 2.5 to 3-head-tall chibi pixel-art character,
    cute and expressive, with highly stylized magical combat effects.


    Before implementing the game, use GPT-image-2.5 in multiple visual production
    stages.


    Stage 1: Generate the Final Game Screenshot / UI Concept


    First, use GPT-image-2.5 to generate one complete, polished, near-final-quality
    16:9 side-scrolling game screenshot / UI concept image.


    This image will become the primary visual reference for the entire project.


    It must establish:


    final art direction

    character proportions

    side-scrolling camera angle

    environmental composition

    lighting

    HUD layout

    color palette

    magical attack effects

    environmental effects

    gameplay prop design

    overall atmosphere

    All later sprites, UI assets, gameplay props, and effects must visually match
    this approved concept image.

    Game World Theme

    Set the game in a:

    Moon Crystal Palace · Celestial Night Festival

    The world should feel like a luxurious magical fantasy realm.

    Do not use an ordinary city street.

    Do not use a simple forest environment.

    The entire world should feel:

    ornate, dreamy, romantic, sparkling, mysterious, elegant, and heavily inspired
    by classic magical-girl fantasy imagery.

    The side-scrolling route should flow continuously through:


    Moonlight Garden → Crystal Corridor → Galaxy Terrace → Moon Shrine


    These environments should connect naturally instead of feeling like completely
    separate levels.


    Area 1: Moonlight Garden


    The game begins inside an enormous moonlit palace garden.


    The background should include:


    gigantic full moon

    deep blue and violet night sky

    dense star field

    aurora-like clouds

    distant floating crystal palace

    oversized white and pink roses

    crescent-shaped flower gardens

    golden railings

    sparkling fountains

    crystal statues

    glowing butterflies

    floating star particles


    The walkable platform should be made from:


    white marble + gold ornamentation + glowing crystal edges


    Some platforms may appear suspended above a magical night sky.


    Area 2: Crystal Corridor


    As the player moves right, the environment transitions into an extremely ornate
    palace corridor.


    Include:


    enormous crystal columns

    golden arches

    moon emblems

    stained-glass windows

    colored moonlight beams passing through glass

    crystal chandeliers

    hanging star ornaments

    long royal carpets

    floating candlelights

    golden mirrored decorations


    The environment should not feel completely static.


    Add subtle animated elements such as:


    sparkling crystals

    drifting stardust

    falling rose petals

    floating light particles

    slowly moving clouds outside the windows

    The environment should feel alive even in pixel-art form.

    Area 3: Galaxy Terrace

    The player eventually reaches a giant palace terrace floating in space.

    The background should show:

    Milky Way

    colorful nebulae

    enormous moon

    distant Earth

    shooting stars

    floating crystals

    constellation lines

    distant palace towers

    The ground should combine:

    white stone

    golden ornamental patterns

    translucent crystal

    embedded starlight

    Some platforms should contain small gaps requiring jumps.

    Some platforms may gently float vertically.

    Area 4: Moon Shrine

    The final section is a monumental Moon Shrine.


    This should be the most visually impressive location in the game.


    At the center is:


    a gigantic Moon Crystal altar.


    The altar should contain:


    golden crescent structures

    enormous transparent crystal

    moon emblems

    white ceremonial stairs

    pink roses

    floating crystal fragments

    orbiting starlight


    When the final objective is completed, the entire shrine should erupt with moonlight.


    Main Character Design

    The protagonist is a chibi moon-themed magical girl warrior.

    Use approximately:

    2.5 to 3-head body proportions.

    Visual characteristics:

    large golden twin buns

    long golden twin tails

    red hair accessories

    blue-and-white sailor-inspired outfit

    red bow

    red boots

    white gloves

    golden crescent moon forehead symbol

    large expressive eyes

    tiny body

    cute but brave expression

    While running:

    twin tails should visibly swing

    bow should bounce slightly

    skirt should have exaggerated pixel animation

    boots may create subtle sparkling particles

    Magical Combat System

    Unlike a pure exploration game, this version must include a simple but visually
    spectacular magical combat system.


    The player can press:


    J or K


    to cast magical attacks.

    Do not use conventional swords or realistic weapons.

    The character fights primarily using:

    moonlight magic.

    Basic Attack: Moon Spark


    Press:


    J


    The character performs a quick casting gesture or swings a magical wand.


    A glowing:


    golden crescent-shaped energy projectile

    launches forward.

    Visual effects should include:

    golden crescent energy

    pink star particles

    white spark flashes

    tiny rainbow refractions

    sparkle trails

    star-shaped glowing particles

    When the projectile hits an enemy, trigger a:

    Pixel Star Burst

    impact effect.

    Powerful Skill: Moon Crystal Burst


    Press:


    K

    This attack consumes Magic / Stamina.

    The character briefly raises her wand.

    A large glowing:


    crescent-shaped magical sigil


    appears above her.


    She then releases an expanding wave of moonlight energy.


    The effect should feel luxurious and spectacular.


    Include:


    pink energy rings

    golden crescent shapes

    bright white flashes

    layered star explosions

    dense pixel sparkles

    flying crystal fragments

    rainbow highlights

    circular magical sigils

    brief screen illumination


    Keep the visual effect intense but relatively short so it does not obstruct gameplay.


    Jump Effects


    When the character jumps, create a:

    small moon-and-star sparkle burst underneath her feet.

    Include:

    stars

    tiny crescent shapes

    pink sparkles

    When landing, create:

    a small circular stardust shockwave.

    Dash Effects


    Add a short-distance Dash ability.


    Press:


    Shift


    The character rapidly dashes forward.


    During the dash:


    leave a golden moonlight trail

    create star particles behind the player

    generate 2 to 3 semi-transparent character afterimages

    exaggerate the movement of the twin tails


    Damage Effects

    When the character receives damage:

    briefly knock her backward

    make the sprite flicker

    release several pink broken-star particles

    briefly display a transparent protective bubble

    Do not use blood.

    Keep the tone cute, magical, and suitable for all ages.

    Enemy Design

    Enemies should not look terrifying.

    Design them as charming:

    Dark Star Creatures

    Possible enemies include:

    small black-purple star monsters

    round shadow spirits

    tiny eclipse bats

    black floating cloud creatures with eyes


    Use primarily:


    black + purple + deep blue

    for enemy colors.

    Add:

    subtle glowing purple outlines.


    This should create a strong contrast against the player''s gold and pink magical
    effects.


    Enemy Defeat Effect


    Defeated enemies must not leave corpses.


    Instead:


    they instantly dissolve into a puff of dark smoke.


    The smoke then bursts into purple star particles.


    Finally:


    a tiny white star floats upward and disappears.


    Main Quest


    The main objective is:


    Recover the 5 Lost Moon Crystal Fragments


    The player must explore the full side-scrolling world and collect:


    5 Moon Crystal Fragments.


    Place them across:


    Moonlight Garden

    Crystal Corridor

    Galaxy Terrace

    hidden platforms

    enemy-protected areas


    Moon Crystal Fragment Design


    Each fragment should look like:

    a translucent pink-and-white magical crystal.

    Inside the crystal include:

    crescent motif

    small star

    pixel glow

    sparkle animation

    When idle, the collectible should:

    slowly float up and down.


    When collected, trigger a small:


    Moonlight Burst


    effect.


    Final Objective


    After the player collects:


    5 / 5 Moon Crystal Fragments


    the Moon Shrine becomes available.


    The player approaches the giant Moon Crystal altar.


    Press:


    E


    to interact.


    The character raises the recovered crystals.


    All 5 fragments begin orbiting around her.


    They then fly toward the altar.


    Trigger a large final magical sequence containing:

    gigantic moon magical sigil

    star explosions

    golden vertical light beam

    pink particles

    crystal refraction effects

    falling rose petals

    intense moonlight illuminating the entire environment

    After the sequence finishes:

    enter the game completion state.

    HUD / UI Design

    The HUD must feel highly polished and ornamental.

    Reference the visual language of:

    1990s Japanese magical-girl anime + premium pixel-art JRPG interfaces

    while keeping all information readable during gameplay.


    Top-left HUD


    Display a chibi character portrait.


    Beside it show:


    Heart Health

    Magic / Stamina Bar


    Top-right HUD


    Display:

    Crystal Fragment counter

    Coin counter

    Timer

    Icons should primarily use:


    moon / star / crystal


    motifs.


    Mini-map


    Place a slim horizontal Mini Map in the upper-right or lower-right area.


    It should indicate:


    current player position

    crystal locations

    final shrine

    checkpoints


    Dialogue System


    When approaching an NPC, display a polished pixel-art Dialogue Box.


    Design elements should include:

    thin gold border

    crescent ornaments

    star decorations

    translucent dark-blue background

    small character portrait

    Do not generate readable text inside any GPT-image-2.5 UI asset.

    Actual dialogue text must be rendered dynamically through HTML Canvas.


    Friendly NPCs


    Add several friendly magical creatures.


    For example:

    Moon Rabbit

    A small white moon rabbit.

    Features:


    red eyes

    golden crescent symbol on forehead

    small blue bow


    The Moon Rabbit can provide quest hints.


    Star Sprite


    A tiny floating star spirit.


    Its body emits:


    a soft warm yellow glow.


    It may hint when a hidden crystal is nearby.


    Checkpoint Design

    Create checkpoints as:

    large magical Moon Lamp structures.

    The object should look like:


    a golden crescent supporting a glowing pink crystal.


    When activated:


    crystal lights up

    stars begin orbiting it

    circular magical sigil appears on the ground


    The checkpoint should feel immediately recognizable.


    Stage 1 Concept Screenshot Requirements


    The first GPT-image-2.5 Concept Screenshot must include:


    chibi magical girl protagonist

    complete side-scrolling composition

    luxurious palace environment

    moonlit nighttime atmosphere

    crystal platforms

    enormous full moon

    stars

    roses

    at least one enemy

    one active crescent magical attack

    collectible crystal

    checkpoint

    polished HUD

    Mini Map

    Dialogue / Quest UI


    The image should immediately communicate:


    a nearly finished, high-quality pixel-art magical-girl side-scrolling action game.


    Do not make it look like rough concept art.


    It should resemble a real gameplay screenshot.


    Aspect ratio:


    16:9


    Stage 2: Generate Production Assets


    Once the Concept Screenshot is established, use GPT-image-2.5 again to create
    all production-ready visual assets while strictly matching the same art direction.


    Panoramic Side-scrolling Background


    Generate a wide side-scrolling environment covering:


    Moonlight Garden → Crystal Corridor → Galaxy Terrace → Moon Shrine


    Do not include:


    HUD

    player

    enemies

    The background must be suitable for horizontal scrolling.

    Create clear environmental depth with:

    Foreground

    Midground

    Background

    layers for Parallax Scrolling.


    Player Sprite Sheet


    Generate a complete sprite sheet for the chibi magical girl.


    Animations must include at minimum:


    Idle


    6 frames

    Run

    8 frames

    Jump


    4 frames


    Fall


    2 frames


    Attack


    6 frames


    Magic Skill


    8 frames


    Dash


    4 frames


    Interact


    4 frames


    Hurt


    3 frames


    Victory


    6 frames


    Across every frame:


    maintain identical frame dimensions

    keep the character consistently centered

    preserve identical pixel scale

    do not alter outfit design

    do not alter facial design

    do not alter hairstyle

    do not alter body proportions


    Magic FX Sprite Sheet

    Generate a dedicated:

    Magic Effects Sprite Sheet

    containing:

    Moon Spark projectile

    Moon Crescent Slash

    Star Burst

    Crystal Explosion

    Sparkle Trail

    Jump Spark

    Dash Trail

    Magic Circle

    Moon Crystal Burst

    Hit Spark

    Enemy Disappear Smoke

    Checkpoint Activation

    Crystal Collect Effect

    Use:

    transparent backgrounds


    or:


    high-contrast Chroma Key backgrounds


    so the assets can later be converted into transparent PNGs.


    HUD / UI Atlas


    Generate:


    Character Portrait Frame

    Hearts

    Magic Bar

    Coin Icon

    Crystal Fragment Icon

    Timer Icon

    Mini Map Frame

    Dialogue Box

    Quest Marker

    Button Prompt

    Shrine / objective progress element

    Checkpoint Icon


    Do not include readable text.


    Gameplay Props Atlas


    Generate:


    Moon Crystal Fragment

    Coins

    Moon Lamp Checkpoint

    Rose Bush

    Crystal Pillar

    Palace Platform Tiles

    Floating Platform

    Golden Fence

    Fountain

    Crystal Statue

    Moon Shrine Objects

    Flower Props

    Star Decorations

    Moon Rabbit NPC

    Star Sprite NPC

    Dark Star Creature enemy

    Shadow Spirit enemy

    Eclipse Bat enemy


    Stage 3: Asset Processing

    For any assets generated using Chroma Key backgrounds:


    automatically:


    remove the background


    convert assets to Transparent PNG

    slice sprite sheets into individual animation frames

    detect frame boundaries


    preserve sharp pixel-art edges


    disable blurred anti-aliasing


    All player sprites and visual effects must use:


    Nearest Neighbor Scaling.


    Do not use:


    Bilinear Filtering.


    Stage 4: Implement the Complete Browser Game

    Build the complete playable game using:

    HTML

    CSS

    JavaScript

    HTML5 Canvas

    Do not create a Landing Page.


    When the project opens:


    the playable game must immediately appear.


    Controls


    Movement

    A / D

    or:

    Left / Right Arrow

    Jump


    Space


    W


    or:


    Up Arrow


    Basic Magical Attack


    J


    Powerful Magic


    K


    Dash

    Shift

    Interact


    E


    Required Game Systems


    Fully implement:


    Side-scrolling camera

    Collision detection

    Platform physics

    Gravity

    Jumping

    Moving platforms

    Health

    Magic / Stamina

    Damage system

    Invincibility Frames

    Enemy AI

    Projectile attacks

    Magical attacks

    Collectibles

    Coin counter

    5 Crystal Fragment quest

    Dialogue progression

    Checkpoints

    Mini-map player indicator

    Quest indicator

    Particle effects

    Attack effects

    Parallax backgrounds

    Screen shake for powerful attacks

    Camera flash during large magical bursts

    Completion state


    Pixel Art Direction


    Use:


    high-quality handcrafted 16-bit / 32-bit Japanese-style pixel art.


    Atmospheric references:


    classic 1990s magical-girl anime

    ornate shoujo fantasy

    dreamy JRPG environments

    moon palace imagery

    magical crystal worlds


    Prioritize:


    Crisp Square Pixels

    High-detail Sprite Art

    Strong Silhouettes

    Layered Pixel Lighting

    Sparkling Magic Effects

    Rich Color Palette

    Polished Game UI

    Cozy + Magical + Mysterious atmosphere


    Primary palette:


    Midnight Blue

    Royal Blue

    Lavender

    Pink

    White

    Gold

    Highlight colors:

    Cyan

    Pale Yellow

    Crystal Pink


    Strictly Avoid


    Do not use:


    Photorealism

    3D Render

    Isometric View

    Top-down View

    Blurry Pixel Art

    Smooth Vector Graphics

    Modern Flat UI

    Logos

    Watermarks

    AI-generated readable text

    Random inconsistent character designs


    Inside every GPT-image-2.5 generated image:

    do not include readable text.

    All text must be implemented through game code.

    Most Important Final Requirement

    The first screen must immediately show:

    the actual playable side-scrolling game.

    Do not show:

    Landing Page

    Start Website

    Product Introduction

    Marketing Page

    Fake Game Screenshot

    When the project opens, the player should immediately see:

    the chibi magical girl standing inside a luxurious moonlit palace environment,
    ready to move, jump, attack, dash, and explore.

    The final result should feel like a genuinely polished:

    luxurious Japanese magical-girl pixel-art side-scrolling action adventure game.'
